      "visualDecision": "All16 paired frames actually inspected. Source and serving agree in the complete head, face, torso, pregnant abdomen, seated lower body, pale plaster texture and plain flat underside. The back is independently modeled and coherent. A few tiny peripheral specks are present in both modes; fine facial detail remains subdued rather than being enhanced. BACK-THREE-QUARTER is the strongest front-facing oblique view; its label is a camera-key convention, not the physical back. This is the small concept model, not either monumental version.",
